This repository includes code adapted from third parties:

- glmocr/pdf.py: the text-layer checks and run extraction are adapted from Indra OCR,
  https://github.com/datalab-to/indra, file indra_ocr/textlayer.py, by Datalab,
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (licenses/indra-ocr-LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt).
  Modified on 2026-10-15: see the docstring of glmocr/pdf.py for what was changed.
  Only the code is used. Indra OCR's model weights, which are under a different license,
  are neither included nor used.

Used at run time, not included:

- glmocr/regions.py and glmocr/layout_worker.py (the region mode, glmocr infer --regions) run
  GLM-OCR's SDK, https://github.com/zai-org/glm-ocr, package glmocr 0.1.5, by Z.ai (zai-org), licensed
  under the Apache License, Version 2.0, unmodified, in an environment of its own that the user
  installs: its layout detector (PP-DocLayoutV3, PaddlePaddle, Apache-2.0) and its result
  formatter, with its default settings except one: unless --drop-margins is given, the labels it
  abandons (headers, footers, page numbers, footnotes) are read as text. The region crop and the
  prompt per kind of region follow the SDK's own.
